---

VIGIL performs static analysis only. It does not execute, evaluate, or
import anything derived from the files it analyzes.

This software is provided "AS IS", without warranties or conditions of any
kind. A verdict of SAFE means no suspicious signals were collected; it is
not proof that a file is benign. See README.md for documented limitations
and THREAT_MODEL.md for the adversary model.

Optional third-party services (VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, URLhaus, Anthropic)
are governed by their own terms. Use the --offline flag to disable all
outbound network access.
